# Nothing here is needed to develop the game: `npm run dev` finds the local game server
# (server/, port 2567) on its own, and Boxity tells every page it serves which
# environment it is in - so no Boxity URL ever goes in this file or the build.

# Point the client at a particular game server instead (local development only).
# Never a Boxity-hosted backend (<id>.host.bloxity.io): hosted builds join through
# Boxity's matchmaker (VITE_LEGION_GAME_ID, set by the deploy workflow).
# VITE_SERVER_URL=ws://localhost:2567

# Run against a whole Boxity stack on this machine: start the dev server with
# BLOXITY_LOCAL=1 (see vite.config.js).
